# Frontend (HTML + Tailwind)

- **Plain HTML/CSS** + **Tailwind** (built to `frontend/dist/assets/app.css`) — no heavy SPA unless required.
- Follow `assets/DESIGN.md` (MD3 tokens, Inter/Manrope, Material Symbols).
- **Hub:** `frontend/src/pages/index.html` lists tool modules.
- **Tool page:** `frontend/src/pages/tools/<tool>.html` — upload, form, execute, log panel (see FreeSurfer).
- Centered layout `max-w-[800px]` for tool pages; top nav with link back to hub.
- Wire forms to `/api/v1/tools/<id>/jobs` via `fetch` + `FormData`.
- Semantic HTML, accessible labels, keyboard-friendly forms; monospace for CLI output.
